+ * pgwire session drives CALL BINDING through the real SQL ingress,
+ * ServiceLifecycleCommandOwner dispatch, and CallCellInvoker composed from
+ * the real CallBindingRouteResolver (over the live system table cache), the
+ * real createCallCellBatchExecutor (over the real engine partition resolver
+ * and SQL parser), the real createCallCellReduceCoordinator (over a real
